      "statusChangeID": "6a73c8f6aa94fe994c6ca710",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "Marking as complete, because we did a full performance sweep and review. Our results:\n\nPerformance did not get worse with the new nameplates, even in worst-case scenarios.\n\nThey didn't get better, either - but we did improve nameplate perf with a recent release. \n\nOur goal perf-wise here was to \"not make it worse\", and we hit the goal. Nameplates will *always* cost some number of frames, they will never be free. We'll see if we can save some more frames in the future.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
